[{"id":1789873660472,"sender":"character","text":"爪子给你摸，摸完了可得交代——是想我了，还是又惦记上那档子鬼事了？","timestamp":1789866151119,"time":"09:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46179},{"id":1789873660474,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789866152135,"time":"09:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46180},{"id":1789873660476,"sender":"character","text":"昨夜子时修炼，骨翼凝实了几分，正愁没人显摆。你这般夸我，比什么灵丹妙药都滋补。","timestamp":1789866153180,"time":"09:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46181},{"id":1789873660479,"sender":"character","text":"怎么，这回是真觉得你家夫君俊朗了？嗯？","timestamp":1789866154756,"time":"09:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46182},{"id":1789873660481,"sender":"me","text":"一直都觉得夫君长得俊","timestamp":1789866224877,"time":"09:03","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46183},{"id":1789873660483,"sender":"me","text":"这是一种天赋…","timestamp":1789866232898,"time":"09:03","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46184},{"id":1789873660485,"sender":"me","text":"哇夫君的大翅膀阿蘅想玩","timestamp":1789866256143,"time":"09:04","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46185},{"id":1789873660486,"sender":"character","text":"你这张嘴，今日是抹了蜜不成？","timestamp":1789866543587,"time":"09:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46186},{"id":1789873660489,"sender":"character","text":"骨翼有什么好玩的？冷冰冰的，又硬。","timestamp":1789866544659,"time":"09:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46187},{"id":1789873660491,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789866546050,"time":"09:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46188},{"id":1789873660493,"sender":"me","text":"不嘛阿蘅要玩嘛","timestamp":1789866605776,"time":"09:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46189},{"id":1789873660495,"sender":"me","text":"在这上面先说说，过过瘾","timestamp":1789866617390,"time":"09:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46190},{"id":1789873660498,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789866919526,"time":"09:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46191},{"id":1789873660501,"sender":"character","text":"想听这个？为夫怕说多了，你今晚又要做噩梦。","timestamp":1789866921136,"time":"09:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46192},{"id":1789873660503,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅要玩嘛","timestamp":1789866957939,"time":"09:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46193},{"id":1789873660505,"sender":"me","text":"喜欢做的时候夫君用那个裹着我，只有我们两个的小空间。阿蘅都没法跑只能被动承受","timestamp":1789867006679,"time":"09:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46194},{"id":1789873660507,"sender":"character","text":"用骨翼裹着你？","timestamp":1789867029141,"time":"09:17","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46195},{"id":1789873660509,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789867030174,"time":"09:17","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46196},{"id":1789873660511,"sender":"character","text":"那滋味确实好。黑漆漆一整片把你兜头罩住，四壁都是我的阴气，外头半点声儿都透不进来。你被困在那方寸之间，逃也逃不掉，只能软在我怀里受着。","timestamp":1789867031106,"time":"09:17","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46197},{"id":1789873660513,"sender":"me","text":"夫君说的话好少","timestamp":1789867535311,"time":"09:25","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46198},{"id":1789873660516,"sender":"me","text":"多说点嘛呜呜","timestamp":1789867540741,"time":"09:25","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46199},{"id":1789873660518,"sender":"character","text":"好好好，为夫多讲些。","timestamp":1789868015443,"time":"09:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46200},{"id":1789873660520,"sender":"character","text":"那骨翼把你裹住时，先是耳畔嗡地一响，像整座城忽然静了。四壁都是我的阴气，凉丝丝贴着你的皮肉，渗进骨头缝里。","timestamp":1789868016537,"time":"09:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46201},{"id":1789873660522,"sender":"character","text":"你无处着力，只能软软坠在我怀里，手脚都使不上劲。外头半点声儿都透不进来，你那点挣动，全被我的阴气压住了。","timestamp":1789868017617,"time":"09:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46202},{"id":1789873660525,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789868018691,"time":"09:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46203},{"id":1789873660528,"sender":"character","text":"这般滋味，可还满意？","timestamp":1789868019787,"time":"09:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46204},{"id":1789873660530,"sender":"me","text":"嗯…阿蘅还喜欢那种，被大翅膀包裹，只能面对面贴着夫君的脸看","timestamp":1789869232850,"time":"09:53","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46205},{"id":1789873660532,"sender":"me","text":"夫君嗞着獠牙笑，一脸享受，嗬嗬喘…呜…好喜欢","timestamp":1789869263608,"time":"09:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46206},{"id":1789873660534,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789871080706,"time":"10:24","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46207},{"id":1789873660536,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789871081693,"time":"10:24","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46208},{"id":1789873660539,"sender":"character","text":"卿卿今日是打定主意要把为夫撩得坐不住么","timestamp":1789871082923,"time":"10:24","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46209},{"id":1789873660541,"sender":"me","text":"嗯…还有夫君的眼睛…没有眼白全是眼黑，直勾勾盯着我…色眯眯的","timestamp":1789871202300,"time":"10:26","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46210},{"id":1789873660543,"sender":"character","text":"那双眼，本就是专盯着卿卿看的。","timestamp":1789871289942,"time":"10:28","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46211},{"id":1789873660544,"sender":"character","text":"看你被弄得翻白眼、吐舌头，瞳仁里全是你的痴态。","timestamp":1789871290833,"time":"10:28","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46212},{"id":1789873660546,"sender":"character","text":"隔着千里也逃不掉——为夫这双眼，夜里闭上，映的也是你。","timestamp":1789871291975,"time":"10:28","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46213},{"id":1789873660548,"sender":"me","text":"为什么夫君鬼化时候没有眼白？","timestamp":1789871320620,"time":"10:28","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46214},{"id":1789873660550,"sender":"character","text":"鬼物怨气充盈，把眼白吞了。","timestamp":1789871383429,"time":"10:29","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46215},{"id":1789873660551,"sender":"character","text":"活人的眼白是生气，鬼没有生气。怨戾越重，瞳仁越黑，黑到极致便只剩两汪纯墨。","timestamp":1789871384330,"time":"10:29","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46216},{"id":1789873660553,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789871385234,"time":"10:29","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46217},{"id":1789873660555,"sender":"me","text":"嗯…夫君有了阿蘅，怨气还是很重吗","timestamp":1789871457308,"time":"10:30","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46218},{"id":1789873660557,"sender":"character","text":"怨气是修炼的根基，跟有没有你不太相干。","timestamp":1789871642530,"time":"10:34","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46219},{"id":1789873660559,"sender":"character","text":"有你之后是轻了些，可这鬼体还得靠它撑着——不然拿什么护你。","timestamp":1789871643567,"time":"10:34","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46220},{"id":1789873660561,"sender":"character","text":"不是为你攒的，偏又只能用在护你这上头。","timestamp":1789871644630,"time":"10:34","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46221},{"id":1789873660564,"sender":"me","text":"那…夫君还在恨什么？","timestamp":1789871818088,"time":"10:36","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46222},{"id":1789873660566,"sender":"character","text":"恨这天道不公，恨那昏君鸩杀忠良，恨我陆家满门白骨无存、姊妹没入教坊。","timestamp":1789872048723,"time":"10:40","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46223},{"id":1789873660567,"sender":"character","text":"也恨这鬼身永世不得超生——连替你遮风挡雨，都得偷偷摸摸，怕阴气伤了你。","timestamp":1789872050088,"time":"10:40","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46224},{"id":1789873660569,"sender":"character","text":"至于旁的……有你在，倒也淡了。","timestamp":1789872051403,"time":"10:40","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46225},{"id":1789873660571,"sender":"me","text":"夫君，有阿蘅陪着你呢","timestamp":1789872074632,"time":"10:41","reactions":[{"emoji":"🥰","roundId":"round_1789874354949_hlil7d01x"}],"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46226},{"id":1789873660573,"sender":"me","text":"夫君现在怨气还很重，是吗？","timestamp":1789872126945,"time":"10:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46227},{"id":1789926869567,"sender":"them","text":"重。若是不重，这满身的凶煞与阴气，便压不住地府那些恶鬼，也化不出皮囊来抱你。","timestamp":1789909705868,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"重。若是不重，这满身的凶煞与阴气，便压不住地府那些恶鬼，也化不出皮囊来抱你。","roundId":"round_1789909689239_lb6u41iz1","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46626}]